{"$schema":"https://json.schemastore.org/sarif-2.1.0.json","runs":[{"artifacts":[{"contents":{"text":"<?ui-args --data-model-package datamodels/example/package/example.data-model.json?>\n<scxml xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2005/07/scxml\" xmlns:datamodel=\"https://github.com/stateforward/scxml.rs/namespaces/datamodel\" version=\"1.0\" datamodel=\"exampel\" datamodel:src=\"https://github.com/stateforward/scxml.rs/datamodels/example\" initial=\"a\">\n  <state id=\"a\">\n    <transition event=\"go\" target=\"done\"/>\n  </state>\n  <final id=\"done\"/>\n</scxml>\n"},"location":{"uri":"tests/ui/datamodel002-name-mismatch.scx"},"mimeType":"application/scxml+xml"}],"columnKind":"utf16CodeUnits","properties":{"diagnosticCounts":{"errors":1,"notes":0,"total":1,"warnings":0},"producer":{"kind":"validator"}},"results":[{"fixes":[{"artifactChanges":[{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/datamodel002-name-mismatch.scx"},"replacements":[{"deletedRegion":{"byteLength":7,"byteOffset":236,"endColumn":160,"endLine":2,"startColumn":153,"startLine":2},"insertedContent":{"text":"example"}}]}],"description":{"text":"use `example`"},"properties":{"applicability":"machine-applicable"}}],"level":"error","locations":[{"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/datamodel002-name-mismatch.scx"},"region":{"endColumn":160,"endLine":2,"startColumn":153,"startLine":2}}}],"message":{"markdown":"the data model is `exampel`, but its package names it `example`\n\n**Note:** the `datamodel` token names the data model the machine's expressions are written in, and the package `datamodel:src` names declares which one it implements; they must agree\n\n**Help:** write `datamodel=\"example\"`, or name the package of `exampel`\n\n**Spec:** SCXML 1.0 §5.1 Data Model","text":"the data model is `exampel`, but its package names it `example`"},"properties":{"byteSpan":{"end":243,"start":236},"category":"semantic"},"relatedLocations":[{"id":1,"message":{"text":"this package declares `example`"},"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/datamodel002-name-mismatch.scx"},"region":{"endColumn":236,"endLine":2,"startColumn":177,"startLine":2}}}],"ruleId":"DATAMODEL002"}],"tool":{"driver":{"informationUri":"https://www.w3.org/TR/scxml/","name":"scxml-validator","rules":[{"defaultConfiguration":{"level":"error"},"fullDescription":{"text":"the core `datamodel` attribute stays the token SCXML 1.0 §3.2.1 defines and names the data model the machine's expressions are written in, while the package `datamodel:src` names declares the one it implements (its manifest's `datamodel`); when they differ, the document's expressions would run in a data model they were not written for"},"help":{"text":"How to fix: write the package's name as the `datamodel` token, or name the package of the data model the token names.\n\nSpecification: SCXML 1.0 §5.1 Data Model\n\nRun `scx --explain DATAMODEL002` for examples."},"helpUri":"https://www.w3.org/TR/scxml/#data-module","id":"DATAMODEL002","name":"DATAMODEL002","properties":{"category":"semantic"},"shortDescription":{"text":"the `datamodel` token is not the name of the package `datamodel:src` names"}}],"semanticVersion":"0.2.0"}}}],"version":"2.1.0"}